        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jen5O",
          "name": "Acceptance",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 1300,
          "content": "375 mobile/fallback · 1024×640 compact · 1440×900 desktop · 200% reflow. All states and 36 component relations require readback. 44px targets / 8px gaps / visible focus / keyboard-pointer-touch parity. Contrast and runtime behavior unverified. Contract remains awaiting_design.",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fCGxU",
          "name": "Home revision / user request",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HOME REVISION: Character showcase replaces centered cinematic layout. Heroes use complete bust.webp artwork with contain sizing and interior clearance; no silhouette clipping. Header adds Heroes and Blogs at user request. Blogs is a proposed destination; runtime route and content remain unresolved. Desktop and compact now use left-aligned copy; mobile exposes Home / Heroes / Blogs directly.",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "fi9Ye",
          "name": "Campaign expansion approved by user",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "CAMPAIGN EXPANSION: user authorized visual identity changes and mock News/Events. Added paper / slate / lilac / acid direction, News and article detail, Game Features, Heroes List, six hero profiles with four exact powers each, Events and detail. Desktop + 375px mobile; compact/reflow pending. Campaign browsing is separate from native in-game hero selection. Original 12 gameplay surface families remain incomplete. No implementation readiness claim.",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans",
          "fontSize": 15,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "wdX8P",
          "name": "Shared editorial branding revision",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "BRANDING REVISION: original editable vector OathFront logo NqrjD. News thumbnail origin A1rpGz uses one shared yellow geometric background with logo top-left. Event origin oz8eb uses one shared dark background with logo top-right. Applied to all 24 list thumbnail instances and four article/event detail covers; shared desktop/mobile header logos updated. Only one reference image was visible for this revision; dark Event treatment is provisional pending the second reference. Mock labels retained.",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "XQmcP",
          "name": "User-approved typography revision",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "TYPOGRAPHY REVISION: all existing UI screens and shared components use Barlow Condensed, as requested from el9uT. Desktop navigation: 20px / 700; mobile navigation: 18px / 700. Heading/body sizes and other weight hierarchies preserved. Original runtime Noto Sans token/source values are unchanged; this is a design proposal. Documentation and baseline Foundations samples remain historical reference, not active UI.",
          "fontFamily": "Barlow Condensed",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vhAZS",
          "name": "Six-hero promotional key art proposal",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "PROMOTIONAL ART: Clash of the Fivefold (slomn) is an AI-generated six-hero illustration requested by the user. Now applied as the Home desktop, compact and mobile background; separate Briar/Cinder cutout layers and their standalone identity captions were removed. Original runtime manifest assets and gameplay identities remain unchanged. Human likeness/publication review remains pending.",
          "fontFamily": "Barlow Condensed",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "u0p9R3",
          "name": "Shared hero environment revision",
          "fill": "$primary",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "HERO ENVIRONMENTS: Six new AI-generated scenery assets are applied consistently to all 12 Heroes List card stages and all 12 Hero Detail stages (desktop/mobile). Briar: forest citadel; Aster: crystal bastion; Lumen: light sanctuary; Cinder: volcanic forge; Vesper: dusk rooftops; Morrow: arcane observatory. Original full-body character images and exact power text are unchanged. These are promotional scenery proposals, not new gameplay locations.",
          "fontFamily": "Barlow Condensed",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
