        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TsQPh",
          "name": "Rules title",
          "fill": "$campaign-paper",
          "content": "INTERACTION & APPLICABILITY",
          "fontFamily": "Barlow Condensed",
          "fontSize": 32,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Y6vePI",
          "name": "Interaction specification",
          "fill": "#D1CFDE",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Keyboard: Tab follows header → filters → content → pagination. Enter activates links; Enter/Space activates buttons. Pointer and touch share the same destinations. Hero browsing tiles are links, not gameplay radio controls. The original in-game selection keeps native radio arrows.\n\nTargets ≥44px, adjacent control gaps ≥8px. Focus uses a visible 3px acid outline with clearance. Each card has one named primary destination. Decorative art is not announced twice. The brand links Home. Long content wraps; no hover-only rules.\n\nLoading disables only the pending action and reserves its layout. Error/empty/recovery variants apply to content lists and details. Selected applies to filters/navigation, not static article prose. Active/disabled do not apply to decorative art. No event registration or reward controls exist.\n\nReduced motion: static art / short fade only; no parallax or required movement. Hero reveal may use 300ms after decode, canceled on selection change. Campaign has no dialogs; Escape is inapplicable here. Existing Pause and Result semantics are unchanged.",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans",
          "fontSize": 15
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "O74WZk",
          "name": "Outstanding",
          "fill": "$campaign-acid",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "DESIGN REVIEW OPEN: 1024px campaign layouts and 200% reflow not drawn. Browser navigation, focus behavior, screen-reader labels and touch testing unverified. In-game hero inspect/cost/target interactions remain a separate incomplete contract scope.",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans",
          "fontSize": 14
        }
      ]
    },
